{"id": "DepCy50P-Wd", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"VOICE\" to get this Free AI Voice Generator. \n\nForget ElevenLabs, there's a free and open source alternative now.\n\nIt can clone your voice from just 3 seconds of audio.\n\nThat's less time than it takes to tie a shoe.\n\nThe tool is called VoiceStudio.\n\nYou just give it a few seconds of your voice.\n\nNo hours of audio, just a short clip.\n\nAnd it copies the exact tone, rhythm, and natural emotions.\n\nIt's like having a clone of your voice on call.\n\nOnce it has your voice, you can generate speech.\n\nYou can create stories too.\n\nOr even a full audiobook.\n\nImagine your voice narrating the whole thing.\n\nAll in your exact voice.\n\nAnd it works across over 600 languages.\n\nSame voice, just in a different language.\n\nSo you can speak languages you've never learned.\n\nThere are controls too, so you can fine tune the result.\n\nYou can change the gender, age, and accent.\n\nYou can adjust the pitch and the emotions.\n\nSo you can shape the voice however you like.\n\nThat's a lot of power for a free tool.\n\nIt also comes with a built-in MCP server.\n\nSo your Claude Code can use it directly.\n\nYour agent can generate audio in your voice.\n\nIt's free, open source, and ready to try.\n\n#elevenlabs #aivoicecloning #voicegenerator #aiaudio #voicestudio", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1792338744, "like_count": 1900, "comment_count": 1669, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2909319249400611a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 68.158, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-1.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPZXB5a2IBV_Ab4Zv54Q4z0_9TzspKZt77lfzRnNb2Ny8n5k5Do4SNDlcowQWFQmJdGuTNvulUZPDoTchgEzFDxqzW_QjD6LH92Q7Q.mp4?_nc_cat=108&_nc_oc=AdoPOI5xbdvwPIzRo7N4aW6zljO-yYZjMh8VAo54a1K